    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/455c8e25f51dcad9041e2282ce10b4ef.avif?t=1754964065\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Necro Siege</strong> is a down and dirty <strong>First-Person Action Horror Shooter</strong> crafted by <strong>one developer</strong> with a love of everything horror and <strong>community-driven development.</strong> In this early stage of development players have the opportunity to <strong>help shape the future of the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Necro Siege</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where humanity is on the brink of extinction as otherworldly abominations rise from the shadows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.poster.avif?t=1754964065\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.webm?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.mp4?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience visceral gunplay and  dismemberment. Then get involved and help make this the game you want it to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dark Dystopian Nightmare with no room for humanity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.poster.avif?t=1754964065\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.webm?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.mp4?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Necro Siege</strong>\u00a0journey through forsaken realms confronting eldritch nightmares, zombies, demons, and other horrors in a desperate fight against the end of all things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.poster.avif?t=1754964065\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.webm?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.mp4?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f CORE FEATURES \u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf Endless Horde Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful waves of demonic enemies. The longer you last, the tougher they get. How long can you hold them off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.poster.avif?t=1754964065\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.webm?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.mp4?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Secrets</strong><br>Explore the ruins of civilization, solve dark puzzles, and uncover hidden areas as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Help Shape the Game</strong><br>As an Early Access title developed by a solo dev, your feedback is crucial. Weapon balance, enemy behavior, puzzle design\u2014you can influence it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Solo Dev Passion Project</strong><br>Crafted by one developer with a love for intense survival games and community-driven development.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/455c8e25f51dcad9041e2282ce10b4ef.avif?t=1754964065\" width=600 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Necro Siege</strong> is a down and dirty <strong>First-Person Action Horror Shooter</strong> crafted by <strong>one developer</strong> with a love of everything horror and <strong>community-driven development.</strong> In this early stage of development players have the opportunity to <strong>help shape the future of the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Necro Siege</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where humanity is on the brink of extinction as otherworldly abominations rise from the shadows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.poster.avif?t=1754964065\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.webm?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/a78add877ee69e85e8863fbea14ce9ac.mp4?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience visceral gunplay and  dismemberment. Then get involved and help make this the game you want it to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dark Dystopian Nightmare with no room for humanity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.poster.avif?t=1754964065\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.webm?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/4abeb28e08d24cacc6bd1923ac79672b.mp4?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Necro Siege</strong>\u00a0journey through forsaken realms confronting eldritch nightmares, zombies, demons, and other horrors in a desperate fight against the end of all things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.poster.avif?t=1754964065\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.webm?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/d27eb360c35fb8c37ea89b75df7136d2.mp4?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f CORE FEATURES \u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf Endless Horde Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful waves of demonic enemies. The longer you last, the tougher they get. How long can you hold them off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.poster.avif?t=1754964065\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.webm?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803570/extras/8757afa8584279ec8f3ec28711cfdf69.mp4?t=1754964065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles &amp; Secrets</strong><br>Explore the ruins of civilization, solve dark puzzles, and uncover hidden areas as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Help Shape the Game</strong><br>As an Early Access title developed by a solo dev, your feedback is crucial. Weapon balance, enemy behavior, puzzle design\u2014you can influence it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Solo Dev Passion Project</strong><br>Crafted by one developer with a love for intense survival games and community-driven development.</p>",
